# Rescue Skiff: "target creature or enchantment card". Same setup as the scenario beside this one, but Bot1 targets the Rest
# in Peace the Faithless Looting discarded: an enchantment card is as legal a target as the creature card, and it returns
# to the battlefield (CR 400.3). Rest in Peace's own enters ability then exiles every card in every graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Faithless Looting
Rescue Skiff
Ornithopter
Rest in Peace
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter; Rest in Peace)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Rescue Skiff.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Rest in Peace)
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Mox Sapphire; Rescue Skiff; Rest in Peace
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Exile = Black Lotus; Faithless Looting; Ornithopter
